  lex_comments_err_unterminated.pcpp - break step of lex_comments.pcpp:
  a block comment never closed (LX0003)

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\lex_comments_err_unterminated.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\lex_comments_err_unterminated.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
